 in `src/bookmarks.ts`. The implementation is correct:

```typescript
export function filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[] {
  if (tags.length === 0) return bookmarks;
  return bookmarks.filter((bookmark) =>
    tags.every(tag => bookmark.tags.includes(tag))
  );
}
```

This correctly implements AND semantics - a bookmark is only included if it has ALL
 the tags in the `tags` array.

